skywire provides CMake targets and a function that runs wiregen:

  find_package(skywire CONFIG REQUIRED)
  skywire_generate(TARGET main LANGUAGE c SPECS msg.json)    # or LANGUAGE cpp

skywire_generate() adds the generated sources and links skywire::c_runtime
(or skywire::cpp_runtime, which brings in protozero). wiregen itself is in
tools/skywire.
